  <text xml:lang="grc">
    <body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.iphigeneia.nauck1889-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0085.iphigeneia.nauck1889-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:iphigeneia"><head xml:lang="grc">ΙΦΙΓΕΝΕΙΑ</head>
          <note type="introduction" xml:lang="mul">Vide Schol. Aristot. locum p. 28 allatum. Aristophanis Ran. 1270 ex hac fabula sumptum esse putavit Asclepiades (vide fr. 238).</note>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="94" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:iphigeneia" xml:id="aesch-fr94">
            <lg xml:lang="grc">
              <l n="1" xml:id="nauck-tfg-1-aesch-94-1">οὔτοι γυναιξὶ . . κυδάζεσθαι· τί γάρ ;</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="sourceContext" xml:lang="mul">Schol. Soph. Ai. 722 : κυδάζεται, λοιδορεῖται, ὑβρίζεται — Αἱσχύλος ἐν Ἰφιγενείᾳ οὔτοι — γάρ ; cf. Suid. v. κυδάζεται, ubi τί γάρ om. post γυναιξὶ videtur addendum esse aut χρὴ cum Blomfieldo in Aesch. Agam. p. 29 aut δεῖ cum Elmsleio. Hesych. 2 p. 547: κυδάζεσθαι· λοιδορεῖσθαι.</note>
          </div>
        </div></body></text>
